<task workspace="2.5in">
<statement>
<p>
Write a short recommendation to the bookstore manager, four to six complete sentences. State the price you recommend and the revenue it produces, compare it to what the store earns now, and address the following: a colleague argues that since raising the price increases revenue, the store should raise it as much as possible. Use your model to explain precisely where that reasoning breaks down.
</p>
